---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact — Brian J. Mueller"
      description="Write to Brian with questions, reflections, your own poems, or speaking and retreat inquiries.">
  <section class="wrap stack stack-l">
    <div class="stack stack-m prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">Get in touch</div>
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <hr class="rule-short" />
      <p class="lede">Thank you for taking a few moments out of your day to read my poems. I hope
         the words resonate.</p>
      <p>Feel free to share some of your own thoughts and reflections — including your own poems.
         Questions, comments, and speaking or retreat inquiries are all welcome, and I'll get back
         to you as soon as I'm able. I usually manage a reply within a day or two.</p>
      <p class="small">Please, no unsolicited business offers.</p>
      <div class="notice">
        <b>The form needs rebuilding.</b> Squarespace form blocks don't migrate. This becomes a
        small Cloudflare Worker that posts to email — built alongside the retreat registration.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
